}

free(str);
str = new_str; 
```

This:

- Reallocates a larger buffer after each match  
- Uses `strncpy()` to copy the text up to the current match
- Updates the new length after each match  
- Continues searching the original string for more matches
- Finally frees the original string and points the string to the new buffer

